[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0344","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0344.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50197","title":"Zalando Skipper OpenPolicyAgent请求体检查绕过漏洞","description":"Zalando Skipper 的 OpenPolicyAgent 集成存在请求体绕过漏洞。当使用 opaAuthorizeRequestWithBody 过滤器时，HTTP/1.1 的 Transfer-Encoding: chunked 编码请求或 HTTP/2 中省略 content-length 伪标头的请求，会导致 ExtractHttpBodyOptionally 函数因 ContentLength 为 -1 而生成空的 raw_body，OPA 策略因此评估到空文档而放行请求，但上游服务却接收到完整的攻击载荷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞绕过基于请求体内容的授权策略（如字段黑名单、内容审核标记等），将恶意载荷透传至后端服务。该漏洞影响 Skipper ≤v0.26.8 版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。官方已在 v0.26.10 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50197","GHSA-659f-rgp5-w4wf"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T20:17:24Z","updated":"2026-07-20T16:17:04Z","remediation":"立即将 zalando/skipper 升级至 v0.26.10 或更高版本（commit 3152f3b0bb52ca89c3564be42434db0a2a1cea23）。如无法立即升级，须在 OPA Rego 策略中额外检查 `input.attributes.request.http.truncated_body` 字段，当该字段为 true 时拒绝请求，防止超长或分块请求体绕过 body 内容检查。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/zalando/skipper/commit/3152f3b0bb52ca89c3564be42434db0a2a1cea23","https://github.com/zalando/skipper/pull/4041","https://github.com/zalando/skipper/releases/tag/v0.26.10","https://github.com/zalando/skipper/security/advisories/GHSA-659f-rgp5-w4wf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50197.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50197.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50197.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/zalando/skipper/CVE-2026-50197.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-50197.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50197.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/61f6b2d4b98e3e29e30dc34c4c2a4eb43c8f5a51/data/reports/GO-2026-5944.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-8qqm-fp2q-v734/GHSA-8qqm-fp2q-v734.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/93d5167c4976c9015270e856ca23ec6140d458aa/cve/CVE-2026-50197.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50197.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0344.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0344.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0344.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0323","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0323.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49834","title":"Sigstore sigstore-go 多日志阈值绕过漏洞","description":"sigstore-go 是 Sigstore 项目用于签名和验证的 Go 语言库。其多日志阈值验证机制存在逻辑缺陷：当配置使用 N>1 个透明日志或 N>1 个签名证书时间戳时，阈值计数按每个条目或每条验证路径的见证者数量计算，而非按日志权威机构计算。这导致单个被攻破的透明日志可通过构造不同索引的多个条目，或单个被攻破的证书时间戳日志通过多次验证（跨多个证书链或嵌入多个 SCT），完全满足多日志阈值要求，从而绕过多日志安全策略。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，但攻击复杂度较高。该漏洞影响 sigstore-go 1.2.0 之前的所有版本，仅破坏签名验证的完整性，不影响机密性和可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49834","GHSA-9vcr-p3rj-q5q6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T20:17:21Z","updated":"2026-07-21T20:25:45Z","remediation":"将 sigstore-go 库升级至 v1.2.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了多日志阈值绕过问题。如使用 Cosign，确认其阈值设置为 1 可不受影响。由于无临时缓解措施，必须完成版本升级才能消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/commit/dbb07e62623edd5b175fb9dd5a41dcb85a159207","https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/pull/633","https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/releases/tag/v1.2.0","https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/security/advisories/GHSA-9vcr-p3rj-q5q6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49834.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-49834.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-49834","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49834.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/CVE-2026-49834.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-49834.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-49834.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/61f6b2d4b98e3e29e30dc34c4c2a4eb43c8f5a51/data/reports/GO-2026-5952.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-9vcr-p3rj-q5q6/GHSA-9vcr-p3rj-q5q6.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-49834.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0323.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0348","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0348.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50273","title":"DataDog dd-trace-dotnet W3C baggage 头部解析不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Datadog .NET Tracer 在实现 W3C Baggage 传播协议时，解析传入的 Baggage HTTP 头部未对提取路径实施条目数量（DD_TRACE_BAGGAGE_MAX_ITEMS，默认 64）或字节大小（DD_TRACE_BAGGAGE_MAX_BYTES，默认 8192）限制。远程未认证攻击者可构造包含大量逗号分隔键值对或单个超大值的 Baggage 头部发送至目标服务，导致追踪器为每个请求分配大量哈希表条目，引发无限制的 CPU 和内存消耗，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响启用了 Baggage 传播样式（默认启用）的所有互联网暴露的 .NET 应用服务，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Datadog 已在 dd-trace-dotnet 3.43.0 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50273","GHSA-38wr-vpc7-2mp4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T18:17:16Z","updated":"2026-07-17T20:17:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 dd-trace-dotnet 至 3.43.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，从 DD_TRACE_PROPAGATION_STYLE（或 DD_TRACE_PROPAGATION_STYLE_EXTRACT）中移除 baggage 以禁用 baggage 提取；同时在上游代理或 Web 服务器（如 Nginx large_client_header_buffers、Apache LimitRequestFieldSize）限制 HTTP 请求头最大大小。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/commit/38092e0d41a36decbe649e048e48ae1b1607292f","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8555","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.43.0","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/security/advisories/GHSA-38wr-vpc7-2mp4","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50273.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50273.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/Datadog.Trace/CVE-2026-50273.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50273.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-50273.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/927c9425d8f7f6609247b04933b3bb339d0de5f8/cve/CVE-2026-50273.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-38wr-vpc7-2mp4/GHSA-38wr-vpc7-2mp4.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50273.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/a6bf5ac7a2ca0e41f63a084ce77e4e18a9b97446/CVEs_log/2026-07-18_zh.md","https://github.com/danielfebrero/Fresh0day-PoCs/blob/ed049b0f8549b25b92b26174db3899b34db0b04f/CVE-2026-50272/docs/AFFECTED.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0348.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0348.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0348.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0561","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0561.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54496","title":"Zcash Foundation Zebra Orchard 交易零知识证明验证绕过漏洞","description":"Zcash Orchard 池的零知识证明电路中，`halo2_gadgets` 库的变基标量乘法 gadget 在实现 double-and-add 算法时，对基点使用了 `assign_advice()` 而非 `copy_advice()`，缺少复制约束将基点值绑定到实际输入，导致恶意证明者可自由选择基点值。攻击者可利用此缺陷绕过多样化地址完整性检查（pk<sub>d</sub> = [ivk] g<sub>d</sub>），使用错误的空化密钥（nk）为同一笔 note 生成不同的 nullifier，实现 Orchard 池内的双花攻击；或伪造花费授权窃取他人资金。该漏洞自 NU5 升级（2022 年 5 月 31 日）起存在，攻击无需认证且链上不可检测，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。修复需升级至 zebrad 5.0.0 / halo2_gadgets 0.5.0 / orchard 0.14.0 / zcash_primitives 0.28.0 / zcashd 6.20.0，并需 NU6.2 硬分叉激活。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54496","GHSA-ww9q-8r59-xv46"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T17:17:16Z","updated":"2026-07-17T18:45:20Z","remediation":"立即升级 zebrad 至 5.0.0 及以上版本、zcashd 至 6.20.0 及以上版本、halo2_gadgets 至 0.5.0 及以上版本、orchard 至 0.14.0 及以上版本、zcash_primitives 至 0.28.0 及以上版本。NU6.2 硬分叉已修复该电路漏洞并重新启用 Orchard 交易。在升级前，节点运营者可部署临时软分叉（如 Zebra 4.5.3）拒绝所有含 Orchard 交易的区块作为临时缓解措施。依赖受影响 crate 的下游项目应同步升级并审计其他使用 assign_advice() 但未施加 copy 约束的代码位置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ZcashFoundation/zebra/releases/tag/v5.0.0","https://github.com/ZcashFoundation/zebra/security/advisories/GHSA-ww9q-8r59-xv46","https://github.com/zcash/halo2/releases/tag/halo2_gadgets-0.5.0","https://github.com/zcash/librustzcash/releases/tag/zcash_primitives-0.28.0","https://github.com/zcash/orchard/releases/tag/0.14.0","https://github.com/zcash/zcash/releases/tag/v6.20.0","https://zfnd.org/zebra-4-5-3-and-5-0-0-emergency-soft-fork-and-nu6-2-activation","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54496.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/cargo/zebrad/CVE-2026-54496.yml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2026/CVE-2026-54496/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54496.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_3_CVE-2026-54496.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51922162e2cbb5914a11ad939c724b426142677c/content/posts/cve-2026-54496.md","https://github.com/Gatos90/security-llm-wiki/blob/a450964b4adf32a972407ab46f3c14bd51a1a393/advisories/cve/CVE-2026-54496.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/61b6c11d066bdf8e461d32b8d1b1447a9b607b34/posts/cve-2026-54496-unknown-vendor-unknown-product.html","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/aced02b678cc4062da6e11482c0850c64f73ef89/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-544xx/CVE-2026-54496.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-07-18_zh.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0561.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0229","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0229.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-63093","title":"Anysphere Cursor IDE Windows 版二进制植入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cursor for Windows 在启动及运行过程中会自动从工作区目录解析并执行 git.exe。攻击者可在仓库根目录放置恶意的 git.exe 文件，当开发者使用 Cursor 打开该仓库时，IDE 会在无任何用户交互和提示的情况下自动执行该恶意二进制文件，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞利用了不受信任的搜索路径（CWE-426），攻击复杂度低，成功利用后可获取当前用户权限下的完整控制权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-059c63e1","CVE-2026-63093"],"sources":["hwpoc","cve"],"published":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Cursor 官方尚未发布修复版本。建议在受管 Windows 系统上通过 AppLocker 或 Windows 应用程序控制策略，禁止从工作区目录（如 %USERPROFILE%\\source\\repos\\）执行 git.exe；个人用户应在隔离环境（如 VM、Windows Sandbox）中打开不受信任的仓库。同时持续关注 Cursor 官方更新，在补丁发布后立即升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/cursor-for-windows-rce-via-malicious-git-exe-in-workspace","https://mindgard.ai/blog/cursor-0day-when-full-disclosure-becomes-the-only-protection-left","https://nvd.nist.gov/view/vuln/detail?vulnId=CVE-2026-63093"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0229.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0416","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0416.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53598","title":"微软 Prompty 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Prompty 加载器在解析 .prompty 文件前沿的 ${file:...} 引用时，未强制限制解析路径在授权目录内，导致路径遍历漏洞。攻击者可构造包含 ${file:../../../etc/passwd} 或 ${file:/etc/passwd} 等恶意路径的提示文件，诱导应用加载不可信的 .prompty 文件，触发任意文件读取，泄露进程可访问的本地敏感文件。影响 PyPI prompty ≤2.0.0b1、npm @prompty/core ≤2.0.0-beta.1、crates.io prompty ≤2.0.0-beta.1、NuGet Prompty.Core ≤2.0.0-beta.1，修复版本分别为 2.0.0b2/2.0.0-beta.2。CVSS 7.5 HIGH，网络攻击向量，低复杂度，无需权限与用户交互，高机密性影响。修复版本默认限制文件引用仅能解析在提示文件目录树内，绝对路径、.. 遍历、符号链接逃逸均被拒绝。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53598","GHSA-wxhm-2mq7-7697"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-16T16:19:12Z","updated":"2026-07-17T14:17:24Z","remediation":"升级 PyPI prompty 到 2.0.0b2 或更高版本，升级 npm @prompty/core 到 2.0.0-beta.2 或更高版本，升级 crates.io prompty 到 2.0.0-beta.2 或更高版本，升级 NuGet Prompty.Core 到 2.0.0-beta.2 或更高版本。升级后验证文件参考扩展已应用 canonicalization 验证，防止路径遍历。此外，请检查当前 .prompty 配置文件是否限制了 allowed_roots，确定合理的根目录，限制 ${file:...} 引用范围。请优先升级到修正版本，对无法立即升级的系统，请先进行网络层访问控制，将 .prompty 文件解析权限定为可信目录作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/microsoft/prompty/commit/88ac9948d7d37995edbb2f6d36913436626c39e1","https://github.com/microsoft/prompty/security/advisories/GHSA-wxhm-2mq7-7697","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53598.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/82c2e2276363b4ef8fca1f40cb47533ebb3183e6/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-53598.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/pypi/prompty/CVE-2026-53598.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/992818ccbdd9f6977091594f07ba513fd996f055/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53598.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/a4d37ff32478ff1702cf9dfb37bf711c928ea219/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-53598/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b2967c74374787d2c3ce14ea33111cd90ca3f359/content/posts/cve-2026-53598.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/22a460a6c302ae8487ab1964eb8c468bc315b979/cve/CVE-2026-53598.html","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/d76d29c73bae88b83713f8105a8ca21aef8b83c6/vulns/prompty/PYSEC-2026-3538.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53598.json","https://github.com/maxgfr/package-checker.sh/blob/c595459a296be97605ba77690d4f3d74a9d6334c/data/osv-cargo.purl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0416.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0416.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0416.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0415","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0415.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53597","title":"Microsoft Prompty 任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Prompty TypeScript 加载器在解析 .prompty 文件前置内容时，直接调用 gray-matter 库且未禁用 JavaScript 前置内容引擎，导致攻击者可构造包含 ---js 可执行前置内容的恶意 .prompty 文件。受影响版本为 @prompty/core v2 预发布版本（>=2.0.0-alpha.1 <2.0.0-beta.3），攻击者诱导受害应用加载恶意提示词文件即可在 Node.js 宿主进程中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，影响加载不可信提示词文件、用户提供提示词路径或来自低信任源提示词包的应用。攻击条件为网络可达、低攻击复杂度、无需权限但需用户交互（诱导加载恶意文件），CVSS 4.0 评分 8.7（HIGH）。升级至 @prompty/core@2.0.0-beta.3 或更高版本可修复，修复显式禁用 js/javascript 前置内容引擎并拒绝执行。修复提交：c27402da2487075be577f06aa79df627fb9d6853。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53597","GHSA-c4gh-rv8h-q9vw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-16T16:19:12Z","updated":"2026-07-18T03:16:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 @prompty/core 至 2.0.0-beta.3 或更高版本（npm install @prompty/core@2.0.0-beta.3）。修复版本已显式禁用 gray-matter 的 js/javascript 前置代码引擎，拒绝执行 ---js 前置内容。暂无法升级时，请勿加载不可信的 .prompty 文件，并限制用户提示路径仅限可信目录。补丁提交：c27402da2487075be577f06aa79df627fb9d6853，已包含拒绝 ---js 前置内容的回归测试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/microsoft/prompty/commit/c27402da2487075be577f06aa79df627fb9d6853","https://github.com/microsoft/prompty/security/advisories/GHSA-c4gh-rv8h-q9vw","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53597.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/82c2e2276363b4ef8fca1f40cb47533ebb3183e6/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-53597.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/992818ccbdd9f6977091594f07ba513fd996f055/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53597.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/npm/@prompty/core/CVE-2026-53597.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/a4d37ff32478ff1702cf9dfb37bf711c928ea219/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-53597/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b2967c74374787d2c3ce14ea33111cd90ca3f359/content/posts/cve-2026-53597.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/22a460a6c302ae8487ab1964eb8c468bc315b979/cve/CVE-2026-53597.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-c4gh-rv8h-q9vw/GHSA-c4gh-rv8h-q9vw.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53597.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/686f05e66750f5d480775bfed77c62e546d41596/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-07-19_10-39-34.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0415.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0879","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0879.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59950","title":"MCP Python SDK WebSocket 服务器传输缺少 Host/Origin 验证漏洞","description":"MCP Python SDK（PyPI 包名 mcp）的已弃用 WebSocket 服务端传输（`mcp.server.websocket.websocket_server`）在建立 WebSocket 握手时未对 `Host` 和 `Origin` 头部进行任何校验，导致跨源 WebSocket 连接缺乏服务端验证机制。远程攻击者可诱导用户访问恶意网页，通过浏览器发起跨源 WebSocket 升级请求，与目标 MCP 服务器完成 `initialize` 握手后，枚举并调用服务器暴露的工具和资源，造成敏感信息泄露或未授权操作。该漏洞影响 1.28.1 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59950","GHSA-vj7q-gjh5-988w"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T21:16:55Z","updated":"2026-07-17T18:07:38Z","remediation":"升级 MCP Python SDK 至 1.28.1 或更高版本，并在调用 `websocket_server()` 时传入 `TransportSecuritySettings` 参数，设置 `enable_dns_rebinding_protection=True` 并配置 `allowed_hosts` / `allowed_origins` 白名单。建议迁移至 Streamable HTTP 传输方式，通过 `FastMCP` 自动启用来源验证保护。如无法升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加 `Host` 和 `Origin` 头校验规则，拒绝非白名单来源的 WebSocket 握手请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/commit/777b8d06710c140e3606b0d4598e2aa48546c266","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/pull/2992","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/releases/tag/v1.28.1","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/security/advisories/GHSA-vj7q-gjh5-988w","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59950.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59950.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59950.json","https://github.com/mcp-security-project/mcp-cve-project/blob/8f19c6692789742733d784a4d63207b68cb14525/cves/CVE-2026-59950.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/5437ac106340c4db3c0703621620b6ce9b73166b/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-59950.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59950.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/mcp/CVE-2026-59950.yml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59950.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-599xx/CVE-2026-59950.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/c7d5dce5040792ac66f5f987fd2ed030b45edce8/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_3_CVE-2026-59950.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0879.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0879.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0627","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0627.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55608","title":"n8n n8n-MCP 多租户HTTP模式授权不当信息泄露漏洞","description":"n8n-MCP 是一款为 AI 助手提供 n8n 节点文档和操作功能的 MCP 服务器。在多租户 HTTP 模式下，由于授权检查不完善，已认证的租户可能访问默认作用域中的工作流版本备份，而非被限制在其自身租户作用域内。攻击者需具备低权限认证身份，利用高复杂度的网络请求绕过租户隔离，导致敏感工作流配置信息泄露或备份被删除。该漏洞影响 n8n-MCP ≤2.57.3 版本，单租户和 stdio 模式不受影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55608","GHSA-2cf7-hpwf-47h9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T21:16:55Z","updated":"2026-07-17T17:11:08Z","remediation":"升级 n8n-mcp 至 2.57.4 或更高版本，该版本在 multi-tenant 模式下强制要求完整租户上下文校验。如无法立即升级，可通过防火墙/反向代理限制 HTTP 端点的网络访问，仅允许受信调用者连接；或改用 stdio 模式运行以消除 multi-tenant HTTP 攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/czlonkowski/n8n-mcp/commit/1f42899749ed0c584fb6b4fd63d75233c3edee59","https://github.com/czlonkowski/n8n-mcp/releases/tag/v2.57.4","https://github.com/czlonkowski/n8n-mcp/security/advisories/GHSA-2cf7-hpwf-47h9","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/51d0584360aea91ec24eaa996cf02372f54dc185/data/vuln/n8n/CVE-2026-55608.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/51d0584360aea91ec24eaa996cf02372f54dc185/data/vuln_en/n8n/CVE-2026-55608.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55608.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55608.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55608.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55608.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55608.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/npm/n8n-mcp/CVE-2026-55608.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-556xx/CVE-2026-55608.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/0c336e1b86972b4210fc8388a318964ce8d85a8e/content/posts/cve-2026-55608.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0627.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0627.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0763","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0763.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52887","title":"NocoBase 通知应用内消息插件 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"NocoBase 是一款 AI 驱动的无代码/低代码平台，其 @nocobase/plugin-notification-in-app-message 插件中的 GET /api/myInAppChannels:list 接口存在 SQL 注入漏洞。攻击者通过 filter[latestMsgReceiveTimestamp][$lt] 参数将恶意表达式直接拼接到 Sequelize.literal() 模板字符串中，未经任何转义或参数绑定，导致已注册认证的任意用户可执行堆叠 PostgreSQL 语句。默认部署中 auth-basic 认证器开启 allowSignUp: true，攻击者可匿名注册账号后利用该漏洞。由于默认 docker-compose.yml 使用 postgres:16 镜像且数据库角色 nocobase 被赋予超级用户权限，攻击者可进一步通过 COPY ... TO PROGRAM 在数据库容器内以 postgres 用户身份执行系统命令，实现任意数据窃取（包括管理员密码哈希）和远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 NocoBase 2.0.57 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。官方已在 2.0.61 版本中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52887","GHSA-p849-8hwh-84j9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T21:16:54Z","updated":"2026-07-20T16:17:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 NocoBase 至 v2.0.61 或更高版本（`docker pull nocobase/nocobase:2.0.61` 并重启容器），该版本已修复 `@nocobase/plugin-notification-in-app-message` 中 `Sequelize.literal()` 的 SQL 注入问题。如无法立即升级，在 `docker-compose.yml` 中将 `POSTGRES_USER` 改为非超级用户角色（如 `nocobase_limited`）并撤销 `rolsuper` 属性，同时在反向代理层限制 `/api/myInAppChannels:list` 的访问权限或禁用匿名注册（设置 `allowSignUp: false`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/nocobase/nocobase/commit/68d64e3fcfb8be2ae4f3bfc9e1ee3f85b87c89ce","https://github.com/nocobase/nocobase/releases/tag/v2.0.61","https://github.com/nocobase/nocobase/security/advisories/GHSA-p849-8hwh-84j9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52887.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-52887.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2026/CVE-2026-52887.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-52887.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-528xx/CVE-2026-52887.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-52887.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/cb0b6a42cd6b56fad8905ad055f6fd839697b5f2/2026/CVE-2026-52887/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/cb0b6a42cd6b56fad8905ad055f6fd839697b5f2/2026/CVE-2026-52887/README_KO.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_2_CVE-2026-52887.md","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/144e072a72718cf976367989b4ef7fcf3f72bd13/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-52887/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0763.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0763.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0704","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0704.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52888","title":"NocoBase NocoBase 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"NocoBase 在 2.0.59 及更早版本中，`@nocobase/plugin-collection-sql` 插件的 `checkSQL()` 函数采用了不完整的关键字黑名单机制，未能限制对 PostgreSQL 系统目录表（如 `pg_shadow`、`pg_roles` 和 `pg_stat_activity`）的访问。具有 admin 权限的攻击者可通过调用 `/api/sqlCollection:execute` 接口发送特制的 SQL 查询，绕过黑名单校验，从而直接读取数据库用户密码哈希、系统角色信息及数据库架构等敏感数据。该漏洞导致应用层权限越权访问数据库系统底层信息，攻击者可进一步通过破解密码哈希实现对数据库的完全控制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52888","GHSA-v8vm-cqh8-q87q"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T21:16:54Z","updated":"2026-07-16T16:19:12Z","remediation":"建议立即将 NocoBase 升级至 v2.1.0-alpha.46 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，可通过配置 PostgreSQL 数据库权限，限制应用程序连接用户对 pg_shadow、pg_authid 等系统目录表的 SELECT 访问权限，以实现深度防御缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/nocobase/nocobase/commit/87c548969ce9258dd7f0d9571c9453ae10bc3fc4","https://github.com/nocobase/nocobase/releases/tag/v2.1.0-alpha.46","https://github.com/nocobase/nocobase/security/advisories/GHSA-v8vm-cqh8-q87q","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2026/CVE-2026-52888.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52888.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/8aa3fb6edbc01998fa6469125b06f34b431f0aea/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52888.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-52888.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-52888.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-52888.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2026/CVE-2026-52888.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-52888.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-528xx/CVE-2026-52888.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/418f362bf2ed654c73aee7f7f643d90e21e1b6c2/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-52888.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0704.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0704.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0704.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0448","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0448.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54052","title":"n8n n8n-MCP 跨租户工作流版本历史越权访问漏洞","description":"n8n-MCP 在多租户 HTTP 部署模式下存在跨租户访问工作流版本备份的授权漏洞（CWE-639）。由于工作流版本历史备份未按租户隔离，已认证的攻击者可通过正常 API 请求读取其他租户的工作流快照，获取其中包含的节点凭证引用和授权标头等敏感信息，还可删除或破坏其他租户的备份数据。该漏洞影响 n8n-MCP 2.56.0 及之前版本，需满足 ENABLE_MULTI_TENANT=true 的多租户 HTTP 部署条件，CVSS 评分 9.9，危害等级严重。开发者已在 2.56.1 版本中通过实例级隔离修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54052","GHSA-j6r7-6fhx-77wx"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T21:16:54Z","updated":"2026-07-18T03:16:37Z","remediation":"立即升级至 n8n-mcp v2.56.1 或更高版本，该版本已隔离各租户的工作流版本历史。如无法立即升级，设置环境变量 `DISABLED_TOOLS=n8n_workflow_versions` 禁用受影响工具，或改为单租户部署（每租户独立实例与数据库），并限制 HTTP 端点仅对可信操作者开放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/czlonkowski/n8n-mcp/releases/tag/v2.56.1","https://github.com/czlonkowski/n8n-mcp/security/advisories/GHSA-j6r7-6fhx-77wx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54052.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54052.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/npm/n8n-mcp/CVE-2026-54052.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54052.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2026/CVE-2026-54052/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54052.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54052.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/2f177ebb4b5452c2c02ca5859b2ea631fa7d5bc4/cve/CVE-2026-54052.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-j6r7-6fhx-77wx/GHSA-j6r7-6fhx-77wx.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/a786a0ea61d8ccdfe1545c54db2093e7bac073d1/proposals/ghsa/GHSA-j6r7-6fhx-77wx.proposal.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0448.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0448.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0394","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0394.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52870","title":"MCP Python SDK 实验性任务功能未授权访问与权限绕过漏洞","description":"MCP Python SDK 实验性任务处理器存在授权缺失漏洞（CWE-862），受影响版本 1.23.0 至 1.27.1。漏洞原理：实验性任务功能启用后，默认处理器（tasks/list、tasks/get、tasks/result、tasks/cancel）仅基于任务标识符操作，未记录创建任务的会话，导致任务隔离失效。影响范围：调用 server.experimental.enable_tasks() 且服务多客户端的 MCP 服务器，CVSS 7.6（HIGH）。攻击条件：攻击者需作为已连接客户端，服务器需启用实验性任务功能且服务多客户端。利用方式：攻击者通过 tasks/list 枚举所有任务，通过 tasks/get 和 tasks/result 读取任意任务状态与结果，消费本应发送给任务创建者的引导消息（如 elicitation 请求），并通过 tasks/cancel 取消他人任务。修复：升级至 1.27.2 或更高版本，或禁用实验性任务功能，或自行实现会话归属校验的任务处理器。修复版本中任务 ID 嵌入不透明会话标记，默认处理器限制会话仅访问自身任务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52870","GHSA-hvrp-rf83-w775"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T20:17:38Z","updated":"2026-07-17T18:07:07Z","remediation":"立即升级 MCP Python SDK 至 1.27.2 或更高版本（pip install -U mcp），修复版本会在任务 ID 中嵌入会话标记并限制会话仅访问自身任务。若无法立即升级，请移除代码中 server.experimental.enable_tasks() 调用以禁用实验性任务功能，或自行实现带会话归属校验的自定义任务处理器作为临时缓解措施。建议同时检查依赖该 SDK 的所有 MCP 服务端部署并同步升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/commit/62137874ff26dd74d2fea80ff528a7fd9ca7a5e7","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/pull/2720","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/releases/tag/v1.27.2","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/security/advisories/GHSA-hvrp-rf83-w775","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52870.json","https://github.com/mcp-security-project/mcp-cve-project/blob/8f19c6692789742733d784a4d63207b68cb14525/cves/CVE-2026-52870.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/f792732d95fcd5791350336c3993c8569599affe/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-52870.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/3a636e9ca4dec610ea52bddffa3cd59a180b7252/pypi/mcp/CVE-2026-52870.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_3_CVE-2026-52870.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a257431e220101b25f51c7e22239ee65d73c4dbf/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52870.json","https://github.com/oxsecurity/megalinter/blob/8a18f344792f20d1c2a7515315a80b5fa6191d7d/.trivyignore","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/f15100526750b2cf9bd4dc0cc587f58f968afb29/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-52870/README.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/9ab526ab0d836fa102f77f626060e2b9458bc808/cve/CVE-2026-52870.html","https://github.com/aws-solutions/generative-ai-application-builder-on-aws/blob/483ace2fb897a5a862c7d51cb6dd41064220d18f/CHANGELOG.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0394.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0393","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0393.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52869","title":"Model Context Protocol Python SDK HTTP 传输会话认证绕过漏洞","description":"MCP Python SDK (PyPI 包名 mcp) 在 1.27.2 版本前存在会话认证绕过漏洞。其 SSE 传输 (mcp.server.sse.SseServerTransport) 和有状态 Streamable HTTP 传输 (mcp.server.streamable_http_manager.StreamableHTTPSessionManager) 在路由请求到现有会话时，仅依据会话标识符 (SSE 使用 session_id 查询参数，Streamable HTTP 使用 Mcp-Session-Id 头) 进行查找，未验证请求的认证主体是否与创建会话时的主体一致。导致任意获取或猜测到会话 ID 的攻击者，可使用不同的 Bearer Token 向该会话注入 JSON-RPC 消息，绕过基于 Bearer Token 的客户端隔离机制。SSE 传输会将响应返回给原客户端的事件流，Streamable HTTP 则直接在注入请求中返回结果，攻击者可读取执行结果。影响范围：使用 SSE 或有状态 Streamable HTTP 传输且启用了 SDK 内置 Bearer Token 认证的服务器（stdio 传输、无状态 Streamable HTTP、未启用认证的服务器不受影响）。攻击条件：攻击者需通过日志泄露、网络监听等途径获取合法会话 ID（随机 UUID，需窃取）。利用方式：攻击者携带窃取的会话 ID 发送携带恶意 JSON-RPC 消息的 HTTP 请求，劫持目标会话执行任意操作。CVSS 3.1 评分 7.1 (HIGH)，向量 CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:L，CWE-639。官方已在 1.27.2 版本修复，修复版本会记录创建会话时的认证主体（OAuth client_id 及 token 的 issuer/subject），拒绝不同主体的请求。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52869","GHSA-jpw9-pfvf-9f58"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T20:17:38Z","updated":"2026-07-17T18:06:50Z","remediation":"立即升级 MCP Python SDK 到 1.27.2 或更高版本，该版本记录了创建会话时的认证主体信息（OAuth 客户端 ID + 令牌的颁发者和主题），并通过 404 响应拒绝不同主体的认证请求。确保自定义认证后端或其他令牌验证器实现类似比对逻辑，如：从令牌的 sub 声明中提取 subject 字段，实现细粒度的用户级会话隔离。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/commit/1abcca2408a6b50e10ec601181f63f9978705c00","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/commit/ce267b6fc515dc4efc1dc70b6975b16ff0feef0a","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/pull/2690","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/pull/2719","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/releases/tag/v1.27.2","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/security/advisories/GHSA-jpw9-pfvf-9f58","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52869.json","https://github.com/mcp-security-project/mcp-cve-project/blob/8f19c6692789742733d784a4d63207b68cb14525/cves/CVE-2026-52869.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/f792732d95fcd5791350336c3993c8569599affe/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-52869.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/velesnitski/yt-mcp/blob/52dfb763e45cbfe7e9957fbb53e0cf86e504c874/docs/adr/030-bump-mcp-sdk-cve-2026-52869.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/3a636e9ca4dec610ea52bddffa3cd59a180b7252/pypi/mcp/CVE-2026-52869.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a257431e220101b25f51c7e22239ee65d73c4dbf/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52869.json","https://github.com/oxsecurity/megalinter/blob/8a18f344792f20d1c2a7515315a80b5fa6191d7d/.trivyignore","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_3_CVE-2026-52869.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/2e88aa481ab4f16d3555ecf032c6cd4a38f5e2ff/content/posts/cve-2026-52869.md","https://github.com/SolaceLabs/solace-agent-mesh/blob/f76d8972fecac522055e8195b704ec631c698c99/pyproject.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0393.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0408","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53518","title":"better-auth OAuth提供程序授权码并发兑换漏洞","description":"Better Auth 的 OAuth 授权码兑换端点 `POST /oauth2/token` 在处理 `authorization_code` 授权类型时，使用非原子的\"查找后删除\"原语来兑换单次使用的授权码。当两个并发请求携带相同的授权码同时到达时，两个请求都会在任一删除操作完成前通过读取步骤，随后均通过 PKCE 验证并调用 `createUserTokens`，从而为同一授权码生成多组独立的访问令牌、刷新令牌和 ID 令牌，违反了 RFC 6749 §4.1.2 关于授权码必须单次使用的规定。该漏洞影响使用 `@better-auth/oauth-provider` 版本 >=1.6.0 且 <1.6.11 的项目，以及使用 `better-auth` >=1.4.8-beta.7 且 <1.6.0 并启用了 oidc-provider 或 mcp 插件的项目，攻击者可通过并发发送携带相同授权码的令牌请求，绕过授权码一次性使用的安全限制，获取额外的访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53518","GHSA-7w99-5wm4-3g79"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T18:16:48Z","updated":"2026-07-21T16:03:12Z","remediation":"立即升级 @better-auth/oauth-provider 至 1.6.11 或更高版本；若使用 better-auth 的 oidc-provider/mcp 插件，需将 better-auth 升级至 1.6.11。临时缓解：在反向代理层对 code 参数做幂等缓存，或在数据库层面为 oauthAccessToken 表添加唯一约束禁止同一授权码重复兑换。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/commit/b4bc65a007784b2eb0efb459e5fa6fd8055d3ec9","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/releases/tag/v1.6.11","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/security/advisories/GHSA-7w99-5wm4-3g79","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d056d8ae56f5d770f04fc59fa77c6fef447db4a1/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53518.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/npm/better-auth/CVE-2026-53518.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1210010a96b67ffb3c2e3cf21ffe55bbcd54dec5/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53518.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53518.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2026-53518.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/598c13a431feec2a954868f732e58a4be64c82c5/content/posts/cve-2026-53518.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/30dd168aecea0b6440311fa6d26d017e87a683f6/posts/cve-2026-53518-npm-better-auth-oauth-provider.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-7w99-5wm4-3g79/GHSA-7w99-5wm4-3g79.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/20783e837c8d3900447582f2695481bf39f8f7ff/data/2026/CVE-2026-53518.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/82c2e2276363b4ef8fca1f40cb47533ebb3183e6/proposals/ghsa/GHSA-7w99-5wm4-3g79.proposal.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0408.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0408.toml"}]